  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under GASB 34, paragraph 112, interfund services provided and used are exchange-like transactions reported as revenues and expenditures in the respective funds, similar to transactions with external parties. The general fund reports the $185,000 as a purchased services expenditure because the payment approximates fair value.
