  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AICPA standards and ASC 105-10-05, financial statements prepared using a special purpose framework must include a note disclosing the basis of accounting and a summary of significant differences from GAAP. Without this disclosure, users cannot assess how the statements differ from GAAP-basis reporting.
