  choices = $EXPL$["Net of tax, presented below discontinued operations on the income statement","As a separate line item reported within operating income on the income statement","No longer a valid GAAP classification -- not separately reported on financial statements","In other comprehensive income, bypassing the income statement entirely"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under ASC 225-20 as amended by ASU 2015-01, the concept of extraordinary items was eliminated from U.S. GAAP. Events previously classified as extraordinary (unusual and infrequent) are now reported within income from continuing operations without separate net-of-tax presentation.
