  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): ASC 250-10-50-4 requires disclosure of the nature of a material estimate change and its effect on income from continuing operations, net income, and related per-share amounts for the current period. If the change affects future periods, that fact must also be disclosed when estimable.
